   }
  ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/spatial": [
   {
    "@id": "http://example.org/oppenheim128#region_02"
   }
  ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
   {
    "@language": "he",
    "@value": "תקופת התלמוד או אחריה (לא ברור; עד תקופת הגאונים)"
   }
  ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote": [
   {
    "@value": "Encyclopaedia Judaica, 'Minor Tractates' (A. Rothkoff), on Encyclopedia.com: Gerim is one of seven brief treatises; 'Some scholars assign them to the end of the geonic period, but recent scholarship favors a much earlier date'; Higger: Palestinian, possibly completed by 400 CE, later modified in Babylonia."
   },
   {
    "@value": "Sefaria, 'Tractate Gerim' (About this text): Composed: Talmudic Israel/Babylon, c. 100 BCE – c. 900 CE; dating and place are debated."
   }
  ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note": [
   {
    "@language": "en",
    "@value": "No specific scholarly dating of Gerim was found; for the minor tractates in general, Higger argues for Palestinian origin possibly completed by about 400 CE, while others place them at the end of the Geonic period."
   }
  ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote": [
   {
    "@value": "לפי היגר רוב המסכתות הקטנות ארץ-ישראליות (עובדו מאוחר יותר בבבל); נכללה ב'שבע מסכתות קטנות ירושלמיות'"
   }
  ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2006/time#hasBeginning": [
   {
    "@id": "http://example.org/oppenheim128#dating_Tractate_Gerim_begin"
   }
  ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2006/time#hasEnd": [
   {
    "@id": "http://example.org/oppenheim128#dating_Tractate_Gerim_end"
   }
  ]
 },
