 {
  "@id": "http://example.org/oppenheim128#dating_Esther_Rabbah",
  "@type": [
   "http://example.org/oppenheim128#DatingAssertion",
   "http://www.w3.org/2006/time#ProperInterval"
  ],
  "http://example.org/oppenheim128#confidence": [
   {
    "@id": "http://example.org/oppenheim128#conf_medium"
   }
  ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/date": [
   {
    "@value": "1100/1300"
   }
  ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source": [
   {
    "@id": "http://example.org/oppenheim128#source_fcb398b124"
   },
   {
    "@id": "http://example.org/oppenheim128#source_2740b4daaf"
   }
  ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/spatial": [
   {
    "@id": "http://example.org/oppenheim128#region_02"
   }
  ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
   {
    "@language": "he",
    "@value": "חלק א' (פרשות א–ו) – עד תחילת המאה ה-6; חלק ב' (ז–י) – המאה ה-11; צורפו במאה ה-12–ה-13"
   }
  ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote": [
   {
    "@value": "Encyclopaedia Judaica, 'Esther Rabbah' (M. D. Herr), on Encyclopedia.com: Esther Rabbah I (sections 1–6) was 'redacted in Ereẓ Israel not later than the beginning of the sixth century'; Esther Rabbah II (7–10) 'about the 11th century'; the two were 'apparently combined by a copyist in the 12th or 13th century'."
   },
   {
    "@value": "Wikipedia (English), 'Esther Rabbah' (cites Strack & Stemberger 1991): According to Strack & Stemberger, it has two parts combined in the 12th or 13th century: an older Palestinian part from c. 500 CE and a younger part, drawing on Yosippon, from the 11th century."
   }
  ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note": [
   {
    "@language": "en",
    "@value": "Herr (EJ) and Strack & Stemberger agree that it has two parts: an older Palestinian part (c. 500) and a younger part (11th century, drawing on Yosippon), joined in the 12th or 13th century; Buber dated the whole after Yosippon."
   }
  ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote": [
   {
    "@value": "חלק א' מדרש אמוראי ארץ-ישראלי; מקום חיבור חלק ב' (השואב מיוסיפון) לא נקבע"
   }
  ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2006/time#hasBeginning": [
   {
    "@id": "http://example.org/oppenheim128#dating_Esther_Rabbah_begin"
   }
  ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2006/time#hasEnd": [
   {
    "@id": "http://example.org/oppenheim128#dating_Esther_Rabbah_end"
   }
  ]
 },
