  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
   {
    "@language": "he",
    "@value": "סוף המאה ה-11 – ראשית המאה ה-12 (חלק מלקח טוב)"
   }
  ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote": [
   {
    "@value": "Sefaria, 'Midrash Lekach Tov on Lamentations' (About this text): Composed c. 1105 – c. 1115 CE."
   },
   {
    "@value": "Wikipedia (English), 'Tobiah ben Eliezer': Lekach Tov covers the Pentateuch and the Five Megillot (Lamentations edited by Nacht); written 1097, revised 1107/8."
   },
   {
    "@value": "Encyclopaedia Judaica (2007), 'Midrash Lekaḥ Tov', on Jewish Virtual Library: Late 11th century; the Lamentations part was published by J. Nacht (1895) and Greenup (1908)."
   }
  ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note": [
   {
    "@language": "en",
    "@value": "None of the sources seen dates the Lamentations section separately; it is treated as part of the same work (Pentateuch and Five Megillot), and Sefaria gives c. 1105–1115 for it."
   }
  ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote": [
   {
    "@value": "חלק מחיבורו של ר' טוביה בן אליעזר (קסטוריה/בלקן); לא נמצא תיארוך נפרד"
   }
  ],
